Subject: [PATCH 22/28] Add grids, TabView, Picker and titled links for Linux

LazyVGrid and LazyHGrid with fixed, flexible and adaptive GridItems lay
out as a custom Layout. TabView shows its children's tabItem labels in an
iPhone tab bar, selects by tag or index, makes a tab when first selected
and keeps it. Picker draws the segmented, inline and menu styles; a menu
picker moves to its next option until menus can be presented. Link gets
its title initializers.
